  "version": "0.1.0",
  "title": "9 V battery and LM7805 regulator on a Nano",
  "summary": "A 9 V PP3 battery feeds an LM7805 5 V regulator, a green LED, and a Nano on VIN. Hold the button to connect a 25 Ω load and watch the 9 V rail sag by ~0.56 V across its 1.7 Ω internal resistance while the 5 V rails stay steady.",
